{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791639985566,"sessionID":"ses_ed9f4bacaffe2fU0aQS8EF17gR","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_237c0b841cbf4e93af534b1f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/AGENTS.md","newString":"- Data flow: component → state store → `ApiService` → REST API. There is no server-side rendering of app data.\n\n## Coding policies\nWhen writing or reviewing code, follow the policy set in `docs/` — the rules are grounded in this repo's actual idioms, and AI agents should treat them as binding:\n- `docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md` — general in-file principles (readability, DRY, early returns, naming, comments, `$derived`, tooling)\n- `docs/STATE_SERVICES.md` — the `src/lib/state/*.svelte.ts` layer\n- `docs/COMPONENTS.md` — the `src/lib/components/**` and `src/routes/**` UI layer\n- `docs/DATA_LAYER.md` — `services/`, `helpers/`, `config/`, `types/`, `i18n/` and the data flow\n- `docs/TESTING.md` — the test coverage plan (\"test logic and contracts, not markup, not third-party internals\")\n\n## Commands","oldString":"- Data flow: component → state store → `ApiService` → REST API. There is no server-side rendering of app data.\n\n## Commands"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/docs/AGENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/docs/AGENTS.md\n+++ /workspace/docs/AGENTS.md\n@@ -48,8 +48,16 @@\n - `src/service-worker.ts` — PWA service worker (app-shell precache, stale-while-revalidate, push notifications); `static/site.webmanifest` is the PWA manifest, `static/themes/*` are runtime-loaded theme CSS.\n - `tests/` — Vitest unit tests for pure helpers/services only (no component or integration tests); run in node env with `TZ=UTC` and `$lib` aliased to `src/lib`.\n - Data flow: component → state store → `ApiService` → REST API. There is no server-side rendering of app data.\n \n+## Coding policies\n+When writing or reviewing code, follow the policy set in `docs/` — the rules are grounded in this repo's actual idioms, and AI agents should treat them as binding:\n+- `docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md` — general in-file principles (readability, DRY, early returns, naming, comments, `$derived`, tooling)\n+- `docs/STATE_SERVICES.md` — the `src/lib/state/*.svelte.ts` layer\n+- `docs/COMPONENTS.md` — the `src/lib/components/**` and `src/routes/**` UI layer\n+- `docs/DATA_LAYER.md` — `services/`, `helpers/`, `config/`, `types/`, `i18n/` and the data flow\n+- `docs/TESTING.md` — the test coverage plan (\"test logic and contracts, not markup, not third-party internals\")\n+\n ## Commands\n - `npm run dev` — start the Vite dev server on port 5173 (expects the API at `http://localhost:8000`)\n - `npm run build` — production build via `vite build` (adapter-node, output in `build/`)\n - `npm run preview` — preview the production build locally\n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/docs/AGENTS.md","patch":"Index: /workspace/docs/AGENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/docs/AGENTS.md\n+++ /workspace/docs/AGENTS.md\n@@ -48,8 +48,16 @@\n - `src/service-worker.ts` — PWA service worker (app-shell precache, stale-while-revalidate, push notifications); `static/site.webmanifest` is the PWA manifest, `static/themes/*` are runtime-loaded theme CSS.\n - `tests/` — Vitest unit tests for pure helpers/services only (no component or integration tests); run in node env with `TZ=UTC` and `$lib` aliased to `src/lib`.\n - Data flow: component → state store → `ApiService` → REST API. There is no server-side rendering of app data.\n \n+## Coding policies\n+When writing or reviewing code, follow the policy set in `docs/` — the rules are grounded in this repo's actual idioms, and AI agents should treat them as binding:\n+- `docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md` — general in-file principles (readability, DRY, early returns, naming, comments, `$derived`, tooling)\n+- `docs/STATE_SERVICES.md` — the `src/lib/state/*.svelte.ts` layer\n+- `docs/COMPONENTS.md` — the `src/lib/components/**` and `src/routes/**` UI layer\n+- `docs/DATA_LAYER.md` — `services/`, `helpers/`, `config/`, `types/`, `i18n/` and the data flow\n+- `docs/TESTING.md` — the test coverage plan (\"test logic and contracts, not markup, not third-party internals\")\n+\n ## Commands\n - `npm run dev` — start the Vite dev server on port 5173 (expects the API at `http://localhost:8000`)\n - `npm run build` — production build via `vite build` (adapter-node, output in `build/`)\n - `npm run preview` — preview the production build locally\n","additions":8,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"docs/AGENTS.md","time":{"start":1791639985547,"end":1791639985562}},"id":"prt_126109297001vn7PQoNBrQhIun","sessionID":"ses_ed9f4bacaffe2fU0aQS8EF17gR","messageID":"msg_1261067d0001UTY3rERdOvdbsL"}}
