      | `{ ok, status, data }`        | `{ ok: false, status, data: null }` |\n | `postRaw<T>(...)`      | POST              | raw typed body                | throws on non-ok JSON |\n | `put(endpoint, body)`  | PUT + JSON/FormData | `true`                      | `false`       |\n-| `postFormData(endpoint, body)` | POST multipart | `true`                    | `false`       |\n+| `postFormData(endpoint, body)` | POST multipart | parsed JSON body (truthy success) | `false`      |\n | `uploadFile(endpoint, id, body)` | POST multipart | `CreateResponse`       | `null`        |\n | `image(endpoint)`      | GET               | `Blob`                        | `null`        |\n \n How it works and what callers rely on:\n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"docs/DATA_LAYER.md","time":{"start":1791640043594,"end":1791640043607}},"id":"prt_126117c410012ldIiHOjo21u3b","sessionID":"ses_ed9f4bacaffe2fU0aQS8EF17gR","messageID":"msg_12610bbfa0013FM6yubRk170bC"}}
