{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791640069569,"sessionID":"ses_ed9f4bacaffe2fU0aQS8EF17gR","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_9d8aa0b2ddae4d11a2303321","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/STATE_SERVICES.md","newString":"Policy for the state layer: `src/lib/state/*.svelte.ts`. These are the\nSvelte 5 runes classes that hold each domain's reactive state and own its\ncommunication with the API. Read\n[`docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md`](BEST_PRACTICES.md) first; this\ndocument applies those general rules to this layer.","oldString":"Policy for the state layer: `src/lib/state/*.svelte.ts`. These are the\nSvelte 5 runes classes that hold each domain's reactive state and own its\ntalk to the API. Read [`docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md`](BEST_PRACTICES.md) first; this\ndocument applies those general rules to this layer."},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/docs/STATE_SERVICES.md\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/docs/STATE_SERVICES.md\n+++ /workspace/docs/STATE_SERVICES.md\n@@ -1,9 +1,10 @@\n # State services\n \n Policy for the state layer: `src/lib/state/*.svelte.ts`. These are the\n Svelte 5 runes classes that hold each domain's reactive state and own its\n-talk to the API. Read [`docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md`](BEST_PRACTICES.md) first; this\n+communication with the API. Read\n+[`docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md`](BEST_PRACTICES.md) first; this\n document applies those general rules to this layer.\n \n ## One class per domain, one file per domain\n \n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/docs/STATE_SERVICES.md","patch":"Index: /workspace/docs/STATE_SERVICES.md\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/docs/STATE_SERVICES.md\n+++ /workspace/docs/STATE_SERVICES.md\n@@ -1,9 +1,10 @@\n # State services\n \n Policy for the state layer: `src/lib/state/*.svelte.ts`. These are the\n Svelte 5 runes classes that hold each domain's reactive state and own its\n-talk to the API. Read [`docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md`](BEST_PRACTICES.md) first; this\n+communication with the API. Read\n+[`docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md`](BEST_PRACTICES.md) first; this\n document applies those general rules to this layer.\n \n ## One class per domain, one file per domain\n \n","additions":2,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"docs/STATE_SERVICES.md","time":{"start":1791640069507,"end":1791640069565}},"id":"prt_12611e1c30014wdLgt3H816e1C","sessionID":"ses_ed9f4bacaffe2fU0aQS8EF17gR","messageID":"msg_12611d31f001Hdoy9BetrrQ529"}}
