se-branch is a compile error.\n+a key missing from any locale (or a stray key) is a compile error.\n \n - **All UI strings live in these files; components read them via\n   `getTranslation().get` (`ts.get.<group>.<key>`)** — see the \"i18n — `ts.get.*`\"\n   section in [`docs/COMPONENTS.md`](COMPONENTS.md).\n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"docs/DATA_LAYER.md","time":{"start":1791640109769,"end":1791640109803}},"id":"prt_126127de7001WzDLEF0ul0soc0","sessionID":"ses_ed9f4bacaffe2fU0aQS8EF17gR","messageID":"msg_1261278ad001oxHCv5bctvtJ0q"}}
