{"type":"text","timestamp":1791640253994,"sessionID":"ses_ed9f4bacaffe2fU0aQS8EF17gR","part":{"id":"prt_1261471b7001AP79GBER2mqgDv","messageID":"msg_126146c48001ijmrA9Tl3UUk7B","sessionID":"ses_ed9f4bacaffe2fU0aQS8EF17gR","type":"text","text":"All six tasks are complete. The job branch `feature/cut_svelte-best-practices` (matches `brief.md`) has a clean worktree and 7 commits, none of which touch `src/**`.\n\n## What was done\n\nA docs-only policy set for how solyto is built, grounded in the actual code — every rule cites a real file/idiom, per the brief's goal of making AI output match the author's style.\n\n**Deliverables** (analyst's recommended layout — four top-level docs, not a monolith):\n\n- **`docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md`** — entry point + general rules: readability first, DRY-without-premature-abstraction, small single-purpose functions, early returns/no nested short-ifs, naming, why-comments (cited `Todos.load()` + `Viewpoint` guard), `$derived` discipline (`canAccessRoute`), TS strict + `import type`, exact `.prettierrc`/tooling, one-section testing stance pointing at `TESTING.md`.\n- **`docs/STATE_SERVICES.md`** — context-singleton stores, `$state` fields, member ordering, preferred constructor DI with zero-arg defaults (`Todos`/`Finances`) vs. older field-init style (`Clipboard`), `load()`+`loaded`, the intentional CRUD pattern, service delegation, `LS_*` persistence, `browser`/`page` guards + `destroy()`, cross-store deps (`QuickAdd`), read-only getters, what-not-to-do.\n- **`docs/COMPONENTS.md`** — lean components, `$props`, Svelte 5-only syntax, extracting conditions out of markup (flagged the `Title.svelte` ternary), shared `ui/`/`forms/` primitives, desktop/mobile split, Tailwind `c-*` conventions, lucide icons, `ts.get.*` i18n, `KeyManager` lifecycle, a11y caveats, testability.\n- **`docs/DATA_LAYER.md`** — one-directional data flow, client-rendered-only guarantee, `ApiService` as the single network seam (method table), endpoints only in `apiRoutes.ts`, pure services/helpers, per-file `config/` responsibilities, `types/` (with the two runtime-value exceptions), four-locale typed i18n, `LocalStorageService`-only persistence.\n- **`docs/AGENTS.md`** (+ mounted root copy) — an 8-line \"Coding policies\" pointer section; flagged as a task-5 judgment call in `implementation.md`.\n- **`docs/jobs/cut_svelte-best-practices/implementation.md`** — full summary.\n\n**Accuracy fixes made during the TASK-6 pass:** corrected `postFormData` success semantics in the ApiService table, `navigation.ts`'s `mobileDefaultOrder`/`mobileVisibleCount` exports, and grounded the DI \"older style\" example in the real code (`Clipboard` still uses field init — `TESTING.md`'s refactor only covered `Todos`/`Finances`). Full findings are in `implementation.md`, including two pre-existing AGENTS.md/TESTING.md inaccuracies noted as out-of-scope follow-ups.","time":{"start":1791640236471,"end":1791640253988}}}
